    # "As the last of their bloody bodies crumpled to the ground, I turned toward Vala."
    "Alors que les derniers de leurs corps ensanglantés s'effondraient au sol, je me tournai vers Vala."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:590
