translate fr qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_72f3238d:

    # "Only the many armed guards the various merchant factions paid to maintain their control gave some semblance of peace."
    "Seuls les nombreux gardes armés que les différentes factions marchandes payaient pour maintenir leur contrôle donnaient un semblant de paix."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3531
translate fr qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_b2cbe1ec:

    # "But beyond the ever looming threat not to to cause unncessary trouble, the city was truly free."
