translate fr qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_df7c51ac:

    # "Stood on some strange rock platform, the two figures, unlike anything I'd ever seen before, turned their gaze towards me."
    "Debout sur une plate-forme rocheuse étrange, les deux silhouettes, comme je n'en avais jamais vues auparavant, tournèrent leur regard vers moi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3687
