    # "The dark god himself... Every child in Alderay knew the story of Malakai."
    "Le dieu sombre lui-même... Chaque enfant d'Alderay connaissait l'histoire de Malakai."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3736
translate fr qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_5c7fea02:

    # "Legend speak of how his betrayal destroyed the old and new gods in the greatest war to ever be fought."
    "La légende raconte comment sa trahison a détruit les anciens et les nouveaux dieux dans la plus grande guerre jamais livrée."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3737
translate fr qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_5e1d502e:

